%% Fase C #10 — Insight mental x resultado (mental x P&L) — ADR-233
%% Fluxo de UMA das 3 queries (tilt/focus/abgame). As 3 batem o mesmo metodo
%% de storage getMentalResultInsights; o handler fatia o sub-bloco. FX 1x/request,
%% helper puro recebe P&L ja em USD. Read-only, sem migration.
sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Jogador MTT
    participant Tab as MentalAnalyticsTab<br/><i>client (3 useQuery)</i>
    participant Route as cooldownAnalytics.ts<br/><i>handleMentalResultTilt</i>
    participant Auth as requireAuth<br/><i>JWT + userId</i>
    participant Storage as storage.getMentalResultInsights<br/><i>I/O + FX + orquestra</i>
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/><i>grind_sessions / cooldown_logs / break_feedbacks</i>
    participant FX as fxResolver<br/><i>resolveExchangeRates / convertToUSD</i>
    participant Pure as buildMentalResultInsights<br/><i>server/coach/mental (puro)</i>

    User->>Tab: Abre aba Mental + escolhe periodo (7d/30d/90d)
    Tab->>Route: GET /api/analytics/mental-result/tilt?period=30d
    Route->>Auth: requireAuth
    alt sem user
        Auth-->>Tab: 401 Unauthorized
    else autenticado
        Auth-->>Route: req.user.userPlatformId
        Route->>Route: resolvePeriod(req)
        alt period invalido
            Route-->>Tab: 400 "period invalido. Aceitos: 7d, 30d, 90d"
        else period ok
            Route->>Storage: getMentalResultInsights(userId, period)

            Note over Storage,DB: 1 scan conjunto base (D-2)
            Storage->>DB: SELECT * FROM grind_sessions<br/>WHERE userId=$ AND status='completed' AND date>=cutoff
            DB-->>Storage: baseSessions[] (id, profit, focoMedio, ...)

            Storage->>DB: SELECT * FROM cooldown_logs<br/>WHERE userId=$ AND sessionId IN (baseIds)
            DB-->>Storage: cooldownBySession (tiltSelfAssessment, abGameAnswers)

            opt focoMedio ausente em alguma sessao
                Storage->>DB: getBreakFeedbacksBySessionIds(userId, sessionIds)
                DB-->>Storage: breakFeedbacks[] (sessionId, foco 0-10)
            end

            Note over Storage,FX: FX resolvido 1x/request (D-3, lesson #9)
            Storage->>FX: resolveExchangeRates(userId)
            alt fxResolver falha
                FX-->>Storage: throw
                Storage->>Storage: console.warn + FALLBACK_FX_RATES
            else ok
                FX-->>Storage: { rates }
            end
            Storage->>FX: convertToUSD(pnlNative, currency, rates) por sessao
            FX-->>Storage: pnlUsd (lesson #6; !finite -> 0)

            Note over Storage,Pure: monta SessionPnlRow[] (tiltType|null, focusValue|null,<br/>abGameBucket|null) — PII fora (D5)
            Storage->>Pure: buildMentalResultInsights(rows, period)
            Note over Pure: buckets + mean/median (N par = 2 centrais) +<br/>deltaVsBaseline (0 em empate, null se lado null) +<br/>dataSufficiency (low < 4 bucket / < 8 baseline)
            Pure-->>Storage: { tilt, focus, abgame }
            Storage-->>Route: MentalResultInsights

            Route->>Route: result.tilt (fatia o sub-bloco)
            Route->>Route: setCacheHeader private, max-age=300
            Route-->>Tab: 200 { period, baseline, buckets[], dataSufficiency }
            Tab-->>User: Card tilt x P&L (delta verde/vermelho;<br/>"Amostra pequena" se low; empty se baseline.n=0)
        end
    end
